// A write into an element of an element that panics after the element
// was moved out of its array (swap.ml): its index is out of bounds for
// the row, which is checked when it's written, after the value. The
// panic is the same as `ren run`'s, at the same place, with the grid's
// other rows alive. build.t runs it under the sanitizers, in both
// builds and both countings.

fn main() uses Console =
  var g = [[1, 2], [3, 4, 5]]
  for k in 0..3
    g[k % 2][k] = g[1][k] * 10
    print(g[k % 2][k])
